    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 4.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">and na béte nán man þæt fýr na læng, þonne man þa halgunge ongínne; ac licge þæt isen uppan þam gledan, oð ðæt þa æftemestan coll.; lecge hit man syððan uppan þam stápelan,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no one shall continue to make up the fire after the consecration has begun, but the iron shall lie upon the embers until the last collect. Then it shall be laid upon the post,</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 na béte nán man þæt fýr na læng, þonne man þa halgunge ongínne; ac licge þæt isen uppan þam gledan oðþæt þa æftemestan coll'; lecge hit man syððan uppan þam stápelan.</ab>
      </div>
